OL,3,GNEWSAMen killed homeless man's dog in
OL,4,A'childish dispute'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fsome readers may find distressing.
OL,9,FTwo men who ran over and killed a
OL,10,Fhomeless man's dog amid a "childish
OL,11,Fdispute" have been jailed for a year
OL,12,Fand a half.
OL,14,FReece Hepplewhite, 25, drove at the
OL,15,Fvictim and his dogs on the instruction
OL,16,Fof his friend Daniel Langley, 30, in
OL,17,FSouth Shields in January, Newcastle
OL,18,FCrown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
